title: "FerroTERM"
abstract: >-
  A pure-Rust FHIR terminology server for SNOMED CT, LOINC, and other clinical
  code systems, with machine-generated
  multi-version FHIR support (R4B, R5, R4, R6) and an index-materialized
  ontology store.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ruben
    family-names: Talstra
license: BUSL-1.1
repository-code: "https://github.com/rubentalstra/FerroTERM"
url: "https://ferroterm.eu"
keywords:
  - FHIR
  - SNOMED CT
  - terminology server
  - ECL
  - Rust
version: 0.1.0
